{
 "title": "Creating Asset Groups",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Creating Asset Groups</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"Use this procedure to group items based on their asset line types before you approve a requisition in the Asset Workbench.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Use this procedure to group items based on their asset line types before you approve a requisition in the Asset Workbench.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loioace1446d42344c5db37190fe9344e0ed\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Creating Asset Groups</h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">Use this procedure to group items based on their asset line types before you approve a\nrequisition in the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Asset Workbench</span>.</p>\n<div class=\"section context\" id=\"loioace1446d42344c5db37190fe9344e0ed__context_hds_wm5_cfb\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div>\n<div class=\"p\">An asset group must fulfill the following conditions:<ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loioace1446d42344c5db37190fe9344e0ed__ul_olg_dnz_5db\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">An asset group must include only one main asset and at least one\nsub-asset.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">All assets must have same asset class, company code, cost center, and\naccounting information.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\" id=\"loioace1446d42344c5db37190fe9344e0ed__steps_ids_wm5_cfb\"><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">From the guided buying home page, open the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Asset Workbench</span>\ntab.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup stepresult\">\n<p class=\"p\">The <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Asset Workbench</span> displays.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Manage</span> and complete the following fields: </span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<div class=\"table-wrapper tablenoborder\"><table summary=\"\" id=\"loioace1446d42344c5db37190fe9344e0ed__table_ict_l2k_zdb\" class=\"table\" data-table-id=\"table_ict_l2k_zdb\" frame=\"border\" border=\"1\" rules=\"all\"><colgroup><col width=\"50%\"><col width=\"50%\"></colgroup><thead class=\"thead\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<tr class=\"row\">\n<th class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" id=\"d27210e91\"><p class=\"p\">Field name</p></th>\n<th class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" id=\"d27210e97\"><p class=\"p\">Action</p></th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n<tr class=\"row\">\n<td class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d27210e91 \"><p class=\"p\">Asset Class</p></td>\n<td class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d27210e97 \"><p class=\"p\">Choose an appropriate asset class for the item.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row\">\n<td class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d27210e91 \"><p class=\"p\">Asset Line Type</p></td>\n<td class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d27210e97 \"><p class=\"p\">Assign the item as a main asset or a sub-asset. </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row\">\n<td class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d27210e91 \"><p class=\"p\">Asset Description</p></td>\n<td class=\"entry\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d27210e97 \"><p class=\"p\">Enter a description for the asset.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Manage Asset Groups</span> and then choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Create\ngroup</span>.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup stepresult\">\n<p class=\"p\">An empty group is created.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Advanced Grouping</span> and then select one main asset line\nitem and the required items having asset line types as sub-asset.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Next</span> and then choose\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Create</span>.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup stepresult\">\n<p class=\"p\">The items are added to the group.</p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">If you want to undo your changes, choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Revert</span>.</span>\n</li></ol></section>\n</div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}